{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5dbc772a-05c0-8fb5-80e4-2360b4d9e781",
  "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:02:08-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Patrick Lynch",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:58:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:58:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. My name is Patrick Lynch. I am calling about a streetlight that is out in front of my house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:59:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. Where's the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:59:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 12 Ocean Avenue. On the Ocean Drive side, not far from the turn."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:59:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 12 Ocean Avenue. And how long has the light been out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:59:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since Monday. Yesterday. Well, I noticed it Monday evening, around five, when it got dark. So it was out Monday night, and again last night. Two nights now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:59:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it completely dark, or is it flickering, or coming on and off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:59:38-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Completely dark. No flicker. I watched it for a while, I thought maybe it was on a timer or something. Nothing. The other lights down the road are fine, so it is just this one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:59:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Do you know if there's a number on the pole? Sometimes there's a little tag on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:59:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] I have not checked. I can go outside. It is a wooden pole, I think, with the lamp arm sticking out toward the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:00:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fine, don't worry about it. The address will do. Is it right in front of the house or a pole over?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:00:18-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right in front. Directly in front of my driveway. So it is very dark there, and cars come around the turn kind of quickly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:00:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I hear you. I'll put in a work order for a crew to check the pole. It could be the bulb, or it could be something on the electrical side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:00:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I would like a crew to check it, yes. I am not an electrician, I just know it is not on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:00:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Can I get a callback number in case we need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:00:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0173."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:00:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0173. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:00:59-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will say, it is a bad week for this. I am a tour guide, and in the off season I have very few bookings. So I am home in the evenings, I see it. I would like it fixed before the few tours I do have, because people walk out here sometimes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:01:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, makes sense. I can't promise which day they'll get out there, but streetlight repairs are usually looked at within a few days to a week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:01:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A week. Okay. That is longer than I would like, but I understand you have a list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:01:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We do. If it's still dark after that, give us a call back and mention this one so we can look at it again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:01:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will do that. So, to confirm, 12 Ocean Avenue, the light in front, out since Monday, crew to check the pole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:01:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Anything else I can help with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:01:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:02:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Lynch. Enjoy your lunch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:02:06-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
